pairdrop-rs
===========

A fork of PairDrop (https://github.com/schlagmichdoch/PairDrop) by schlagmichdoch,
replacing the Node.js signaling server in `server/` with a Rust implementation in `src/`.

The web client under `public/` is PairDrop's, carried over and modified.

